{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":10},"L'Origine de la violence (The Origin of Violence)","Lors d’un voyage scolaire en Allemagne, un jeune professeur, Nathan Fabre, découvre au camp de concentration de Buchenwald la photographie d’un détenu ressemblant à son père. Il décide alors de se lancer dans une recherche qui va bouleverser sa vie. (During a school trip to Germany, Nathan Fabre, a young teacher, discovers a photograph of a prisoner in Buchenwald concentration camp who closely resembles his father. He decides to then carry out research which will turn his life upside down.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9],"fatherhood","personal memory","grandfatherhood","multigenerational family","collective trauma","personal trauma",{"type":11,"id":12,"slug":13,"title":14,"release":17,"filmType":21,"directors":22,"genre":31,"media":33,"synopsis":36,"production":39,"characters":46,"roles":60,"awards":109,"tags":3},"Film","FR2016_086","fr2016-086-l-origine-de-la-violence",{"native":15,"english":16},"L'Origine de la violence","The Origin of Violence",{"type":18,"date":19,"year":20},"Theatrical release","2016-05-25",2016,"Fiction film",[23],{"id":24,"slug":25,"name":24,"birthYear":26,"deathYear":27,"gender":28,"nationality":29,"awards":30},"Élie Chouraqui","elie-chouraqui",1950,0,"Male identifying","Israel",[],[32],"Drama",{"posterUrl":34,"trailerUrl":35},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/27/105/157979/format_page/l-origine-de-la-violence.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4AvJGzXCMHI",{"native":37,"english":38},"Lors d’un voyage scolaire en Allemagne, un jeune professeur, Nathan Fabre, découvre au camp de concentration de Buchenwald la photographie d’un détenu ressemblant à son père. Il décide alors de se lancer dans une recherche qui va bouleverser sa vie.","During a school trip to Germany, Nathan Fabre, a young teacher, discovers a photograph of a prisoner in Buchenwald concentration camp who closely resembles his father. He decide